      "purpose": "`keyphrase` generates cryptographically random passwords, EFF-list passphrases, and BIP-39 mnemonics for Go. Selection is unbiased, policies are validated before generation, entropy is derived from the exact output distribution, and randomness is injectable through a context-aware interface.",
